# Network captures. A HAR of an authenticated portal holds the credential
# exchange, session headers and whatever customer data was on screen — the
# Shams MIS discovery capture holds all three. Useful to keep locally, never
# to commit.
*.har

# Supabase CLI local link state (project ref, pooler URL, server versions).
# Machine-local and re-created by `supabase link` — never commit it.
supabase/.temp/
